<mxCell id="note" value="PK = primary key • FK = foreign key • UQ = proposed unique constraint. Yellow = appointment hub; blue = proposed supporting tables. Cardinalities read parent → children. Dashed intent link summarizes two optional FKs. This selected core is not a complete schema. Every column, key, cardinality, constraint and storage choice is proposed—not approved." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=12;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1060" width="1570" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
